This package bundles no third-party components.

Its npm dependencies keep their own licenses. The icon data comes at runtime from the
@iconify-json sets: Tabler, Flowbite, Heroicons, Iconoir and Bootstrap Icons (MIT),
Lucide (ISC) and Remix Icon (Apache-2.0). @iconify-json/ri is pinned to exactly 1.2.10
(Remix Icon 4.8.0): from Remix Icon 4.9.0 on, a license of its own applies that forbids
competing icon libraries.
